      "title": "Image: text to image with Ming Image 0.1 Design",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Image: text to image with Ming Image 0.1 Design\n\nMakes up to 4 images from a prompt with Ming Image 0.1 Design in 12 steps. Built from Comfy's template image_ming_image_01_design_t2i.\n\n## Models\n\n- [ming_image_0.1_design_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ming-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ming_image_0.1_design_int8_convrot.safetensors): Ming Image 0.1 Design, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/Ming-Image-0.1-Design).\n- [ming_image_0.1_ling_mini_2.0_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ming-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/ming_image_0.1_ling_mini_2.0_int8_convrot.safetensors): Ling mini 2.0 text encoder, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/Ming-Image-0.1-Design).\n- [ming_image_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ming-Image/resolve/main/vae/ming_image_vae_bf16.safetensors): Ming Image VAE, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/Ming-Image-0.1-Design).\n\nThe template's prompt enhancer is left out, so the prompt reaches the model as you wrote it.\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
